            <h4 style="font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 400; font-size: 1.45rem; line-height: 1.25; margin: 26px 0 0; color: var(--ink);">What we did: replaced a relative scoring model with a fair, data-driven framework that evaluates technicians against absolute standards.</h4>
